{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：02:40 2026-11-28 HKT<br/>發佈時間：02:40 2026-11-28 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：02:40 2026-11-28 HKT</p><img alt=\"fb@將軍澳主場\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9173164b27f1d6c6055e9184433b17cd/2026-11/2026-11-27_18_23_30.png\"/><p>坑口發現男屍。周六（28日）約凌晨1時，警方接獲途人報案，寶康路105號至107號香港單車館外空地，一名年約70多歲男子倒臥現場，已失去意識。</p><p>救援人員接報到場，證實男子當場死亡，由仵工移走遺體。警方正於現場調查，死者身份及死因有待確定。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T19:04:20.154949+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":202,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T18:40:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T18:57:48.880267+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T18:57:48.880267+00:00","content_hash":"d2babc7359e9fcb6ef00834228b1c98a964498fcd0b72842eb4e2182075c85a8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}